I started playing Nethack about a year and a half ago but stopped
playing after about 6 months. I never got deeper than sokoban. I
recently started playing again, and, after many false starts, I got a
Lawful Himan Valkyrie down to Minetown very easily after finding a
platemail on DL 1. I traded up my gear and was well below 0 AC in no
time.  Having found a luckstone in the first 3 levels of the mines, I
skipped the rest of the mines, cruised down, dipping for Excalibur at
XP 5, and made it through sokoban easily winning an amulet of
reflection.

At this point I thought I might actually have a good game going. About
DL 16 I found a altar,did a bit of sacrificing, and picked up Mojo. I
ate a wraith corpse and quaffed a potion of gain level to hit XP 14 so
I could quest.  It was surprisingly easy, and I wishfully thought that
I might actually ascend.

I continued downward until I ran into a (master?)lich on a maze-like
level. I didn't have MR yet, but thought I could bash him senseless
before he did too much bad stuff. Yeah right. I got away with 1 piece
of armor intact and a cursed inventory by level-porting by #invoking
the Orb of Fate. Luckily I ported to the Big Room level, which had a
fair amount of armor I'd left sitting about and no monsters.
Now I realized I had a spare magic lamp, so I blessed, rubbed, and
wished for some gray dragon scale mail.  I trotted right back down to
that lich and blasted his face off with Mojo.

I had no problems with Medusa, the castle or anything between.  With
the wand of wishing I wished up some scrolls of charging, a ring of
teleport control(probably a waste, but I really wanted to be able to
level-port between stashes right now), recharged, and saved the last
three.  I had picked up a magic marker so I ported back to my stash
and wrote several enchant armor scrolls and now my AC was at -33
(including 8? points of divine protection).

Feeling ready for anything I ported back down to the castle and
entered Gehennom for the first time. I paid off Asmodeus, killed
Jubilex in about 3 hits, paid off Baalzebub, and defeated Orcus rather
easily after chasing his teleporting face around for a bit.  Again
into the maze levels... boring... "Hey look a cockatrice.  Oooh, it
left a corpse." The second or third one I'd seen in this latest batch
of games, and I haven't wielded one yet.  Check, double-checks, triple
checks inventory. "Yes I am wearing gloves. Awesome, lets make some
statues!  You wield a cockatrice corpse.  Hmm, a long hallway, I'll
use the g command to move along it quickly.  Wait, watch out for that
pit! DYWYPI? CRAP!

I don't know how long it will take me to recover from this loss. I am
terribly dissapointed.  Words of consolation? please?


